 61CU c  E({+3}He)=22.5 MeV from iThemba Labs Separated Sector cyclotron        
 61CU2c  facility. Target=9.6 mg/cm{+2} thick. Gamma rays were detected using   
 61CU3c  AFRODITE array of nine BGO-shielded Clover HPGe detectors, five at     
 61CU4c  90|' and four at 135|' with respect to the beam direction. Neutron     
 61CU5c  detector consisted of an array of nine large-volume NE102A plastic     
 61CU6c  scintillators, placed symmetrically about |q(lab)=0|' and 90|' to      
 61CU7c  the beam direction. Measured E|g, n|g-coin. Deduced population         
 61CU8c  strengths of L=0, 7/2- states and compared to shell model              
 61CU9c  and reaction cross section calculations.                               
